flowchart LR
    UI[Activity / Fragment / Adapter] -->|observe LiveData| VM[ViewModel]
    VM -->|gọi| REPO[Repository]
    REPO -->|nguồn chính| FS[(Firebase Firestore)]
    REPO -->|cache đã xem| ROOM[(Room SQLite)]
    REPO -->|JSON| API[Dictionary API]
    FS -->|snapshot listener| REPO
    ROOM -->|offline fallback| REPO
    API -->|OkHttp + Gson| REPO
    REPO -->|postValue| VM
    VM -->|UiState| UI
    WORK[WorkManager] -->|pending question| FS
    JOB[JobScheduler] -->|cache cleanup| ROOM
    ALARM[AlarmManager] -->|promo reminder| NOTI[Notification]
    SERVICE[Foreground Service] -->|audio| NOTI
